        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>ABH 6000 Series Hospital Push / Pull Latch Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPush / Pull Latches for installations where both versatility and durability are critical. Ideal for use on hospital, medical and industrial doors when hands free door open is required. Uses (4) thru-bolts to mount for maximum stability. UL Listed and ADA compliant. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 2-3/4\", 3-3/4\" or 5\" backset. The short throw angle allows an easy push or pull action to open the door even when hands are not free.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-6000-series-dimensions.png?v=1704354764\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ABH 6000 Series Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nABH 6000 Series can be mounted in different positions:\r\n<li>Both handles down</li>\r\n<li>Both handles up</li>\r\n<li>One handle down and one handle up (either push or pull side of door)</li>\r\n<li>Both handles point away from latch (Requires 5\" Backset)</li>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the ABH 6000 Series Push/Pull Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>US32D Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a>.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed for Fire Doors up to 90 minutes </li>\r\n<li>Variable mounting positions</li>\r\n<li>Function: Passage</li>\r\n<li>Projection off Door: 2-3/4\" Maximum</li>\r\n<li>Body Width: 2-11/16\" Maximum</li>\r\n<li>Body Height: 4-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Push/Pull Handle Height: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li> Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6000_install.pdf?v=1691093120\" target=\"new\"><b> ABH 6000 Installation (PDF)</b></a> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
